    "documentation_notes": "worst quality, low quality, score_1, score_2, score_3, blurry, jpeg artifacts, sepia, bad hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, deformed, distorted face, text, watermark, logo, jpeg artifacts\n\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_7, safe, 1girl, solo, a beautiful young woman, long flowing purple hair, elegant features, wearing a flowing white dress, sitting gracefully on a giant fantastical mushroom, serene expression, lush fantasy forest setting, dappled sunlight filtering through ancient trees, volumetric lighting, centered composition, medium shot, deep emerald and violet color palette, anime illustration, detailed character design, soft shading, painterly background, high detail\n\n{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h2>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"model-v4\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load Diffusion Model</h3><p>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/anima-base-v1.0.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download anima-base-v1.0.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">3.9 GB</span></a></span>&nbsp;\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #888888\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/anima<br><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Read More About the Model</a></span>&nbsp;</div><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" conten